{"id":"f8b61370b9b75b32","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-primepatterns.md","title":"Prime patterns are filtered prime implicants of the greatest extension","display":"thm-primepatterns — Prime patterns are filtered prime implicants of the greatest extension","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-primepatterns","aliases":["27-thm-primepatterns"],"display":"thm-primepatterns — Prime patterns are filtered prime implicants of the greatest extension","depends_on":["[[27-df-pdbfpi]]","[[27-df-pattern]]","[[27-df-extrema]]","[[27-df-piset]]","[[27-df-impset]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.2.3 Lemma 12.1 and proof","source_printed_pages":"518","source_pdf_pages":"542","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-primepatterns"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-primepatterns</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-primepatterns — Prime patterns are filtered prime implicants of the greatest extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04f9638612cfbb2f\" href=\"?note=04f9638612cfbb2f\" title=\"27-df-pdbfpi\">27-df-pdbfpi</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5b4178d75957ed66\" href=\"?note=5b4178d75957ed66\" title=\"27-df-pattern\">27-df-pattern</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"002418bdd321687f\" href=\"?note=002418bdd321687f\" title=\"27-df-extrema\">27-df-extrema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.2.3 Lemma 12.1 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"518"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"542"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\">\\((T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"04f9638612cfbb2f\" href=\"?note=04f9638612cfbb2f\" title=\"27-df-pdbfpi\">27-df-pdbfpi</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5b4178d75957ed66\" href=\"?note=5b4178d75957ed66\" title=\"27-df-pattern\">27-df-pattern</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"002418bdd321687f\" href=\"?note=002418bdd321687f\" title=\"27-df-extrema\">27-df-extrema</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pat}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5b4178d75957ed66\" href=\"?note=5b4178d75957ed66\" title=\"27-df-pattern\">27-df-pattern</a>，二参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"04f9638612cfbb2f\" href=\"?note=04f9638612cfbb2f\" title=\"27-df-pdbfpi\">27-df-pdbfpi</a>，一参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pat}(T,F)=\\{U\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f^+_{T,F})\\mid\\exists a\\in T\\;(U(a)=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Pat}(T,F)=\\{U\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f^+_{T,F})\\mid\\exists a\\in T\\;(U(a)=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)=\\{U\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f^+_{T,F})\\mid\\exists a\\in T\\;(U(a)=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)=\\{U\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f^+_{T,F})\\mid\\exists a\\in T\\;(U(a)=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>避开 F 恰为蕴含 f⁺；删文字只扩大真点集，所以已经覆盖的正样本不会丢失。故模式的极大性与 f⁺ 的 prime implicant 条件一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pdbfpi","status":"resolved","id":"04f9638612cfbb2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pdbfpi]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pattern]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extrema","status":"resolved","id":"002418bdd321687f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extrema]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-impset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pdbfpi","status":"resolved","id":"04f9638612cfbb2f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；见 [[27-df-pdbfpi]]、[[27-df-pattern]]、[[27-df-extrema]]、[[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-impset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；见 [[27-df-pdbfpi]]、[[27-df-pattern]]、[[27-df-extrema]]、[[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-impset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extrema","status":"resolved","id":"002418bdd321687f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；见 [[27-df-pdbfpi]]、[[27-df-pattern]]、[[27-df-extrema]]、[[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-impset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；见 [[27-df-pdbfpi]]、[[27-df-pattern]]、[[27-df-extrema]]、[[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-impset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；见 [[27-df-pdbfpi]]、[[27-df-pattern]]、[[27-df-extrema]]、[[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-impset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pat}$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，二参数 $\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)$ 见 [[27-df-pdbfpi]]，一参数 $\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]，$\\mathrm{Imp}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-impset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pdbfpi","status":"resolved","id":"04f9638612cfbb2f","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pat}$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，二参数 $\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)$ 见 [[27-df-pdbfpi]]，一参数 $\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]，$\\mathrm{Imp}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-impset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pat}$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，二参数 $\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)$ 见 [[27-df-pdbfpi]]，一参数 $\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]，$\\mathrm{Imp}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-impset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pat}$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，二参数 $\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)$ 见 [[27-df-pdbfpi]]，一参数 $\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]，$\\mathrm{Imp}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-impset]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Imp}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pat}(T,F)=\\{U\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f^+_{T,F})\\mid\\exists a\\in T\\;(U(a)=1)\\}.","display":true},{"te